TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 with equilibrium phases
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -saturation_indices Mirabilite
END
